 ctprojection:['離散投影與重建資訊鏈','Discrete projections and reconstruction chain','重建結果應與前向投影及原始資料互相核對','Cross-check a reconstruction with forward projections and original data','重建圖看起來清晰就保證資料一致','A sharp image guarantees data consistency','合成射線和：1+2+1','Synthetic line sum: 1+2+1',4],
