 resourcenetwork:['跨企業水、能源與物料','Inter-company water, energy and materials','交換流要標明來源、接收者、品質和責任','Identify source, receiver, quality and responsibility for exchanges','跨廠箭頭本身就證明適用性與節省量','An inter-company arrow proves suitability and savings','圖示交換資源類別','Resource categories shown',3],
